{"name": "Railway Routes", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build the Perfect Railway Route</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Railway Routes is a relaxing <strong>grid-based railway puzzle</strong> where you draw tracks, guide trains, and create the perfect route. Each level challenges your logic, planning, and creativity as you build efficient railway networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/849d5156b7c149e639580a1d0f1dffa2.poster.avif?t=1785348672\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/849d5156b7c149e639580a1d0f1dffa2.webm?t=1785348672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/849d5156b7c149e639580a1d0f1dffa2.mp4?t=1785348672\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With cozy visuals and satisfying track-building mechanics, Railway Routes delivers a calm puzzle experience that is easy to learn but full of clever challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Handcrafted Puzzle Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level introduces new obstacles and ideas that gradually expand the gameplay. Experiment with different solutions and discover the most efficient route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/5e45a1e3bd537599b3ac567e2971d09b.poster.avif?t=1785348672\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/5e45a1e3bd537599b3ac567e2971d09b.webm?t=1785348672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/5e45a1e3bd537599b3ac567e2971d09b.mp4?t=1785348672\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan carefully, think ahead, and optimize your railway to complete every challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Over 100 Levels to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through a large set of handcrafted puzzles with increasing difficulty. Every stage is designed to introduce new ideas while keeping the experience relaxing and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/36ead6717b201be23969433da34fad0a.poster.avif?t=1785348672\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/36ead6717b201be23969433da34fad0a.webm?t=1785348672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/36ead6717b201be23969433da34fad0a.mp4?t=1785348672\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relax and Experiment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Undo, retry, and test different layouts freely. There\u2019s always more than one solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/671597ebab4359a28a7df78d74ff9a2b.poster.avif?t=1785348672\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/671597ebab4359a28a7df78d74ff9a2b.webm?t=1785348672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/extras/671597ebab4359a28a7df78d74ff9a2b.mp4?t=1785348672\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude86 Build railway tracks on a grid-based puzzle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Solve clever logic and planning challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa Over 100 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f Relaxing visuals and cozy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 Undo and retry anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf Multiple solutions for each puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude89 Satisfying track-building mechanics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Think Ahead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes the shortest path is not the best one. You\u2019ll need to avoid obstacles, optimize space, and carefully guide trains to their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you build the perfect railway route? Start planning and watch your railway come to life.</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Guide trains, build tracks, and solve relaxing grid-based railway puzzles. Plan the perfect route across 100+ handcrafted levels and watch your railway come to life.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533200/9b8e9c81dc24e0508ac201f6fa9d6aee4cf9548a/header.jpg?t=1785348672", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Logic", "Trains", "Grid-Based Movement", "Relaxing", "Casual"], "developers": "Rising Moon Games", "publishers": "Rising Moon Games", "release_date": "Jul 14, 2026", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "4533200", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://yout